= Women's Work

Clara Zetkin points out that women are half the working class and a fraction of the party. Prices are their battlefield: they queue for bread while the mark falls.

- @committees
- @later

@committees
title: Lead the housewives' price committees.
subtitle: More members and standing in the cities. Costs 1 resource.
choose-if: funds >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Needs 1 resource.
on-arrival: {!
Q.funds -= 1;
Q.members += 3;
Q.rev_situation += 1;
window.RF.normalize(Q);
!}

Women's delegations march on markets and town halls against profiteers.

@later
title: Not now; there are more urgent tasks.
subtitle: No cost.
on-arrival: {!

window.RF.normalize(Q);
!}

Zetkin is not pleased.
